**:Jotayi Ibupran says, 'My master has sent you? Such is the will of Cazic-Thule. I beseech you to be my vengeance. Before the war, I was friend to a paladin named Inte Akera, a man who could not let go of his sense of zeal. In our last battle, I fell to his blade, leaving me now the grim image you see before you. I believe he must have left Norrath some time ago, as I can no longer sense his life force anymore. It would bring my soul to rest to see his face beyond the veil. '
